<https://github.com/john1hsu/ai-knowledge-graph/id/batching-and-paged-attention> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A pair of LLM-serving techniques: continuous (iteration-level) batching reschedules the batch after every decoding step so finished requests leave and new ones join immediately, and PagedAttention stores each request's KV cache in small fixed-size blocks, like virtual-memory pages, so far more requests fit in GPU memory." .
