<https://github.com/john1hsu/ai-knowledge-graph/id/star-self-taught-reasoner> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An iterative self-training method in which a language model generates step-by-step rationales for training questions, keeps only those that reach the correct answer (retrying with the answer as a hint when it fails), and is fine-tuned on them, so its reasoning improves without a large human-written rationale dataset." .
